# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key.
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# The key is all that belongs here: it is a secret, and it is read once when the
# process starts. Everything else — the model, the pace, the spend limits — is
# in `settings.env`, which is in the repo with a working value for each and is
# re-read whenever it changes, so it needs no restart.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
